  },
  "changes": [
    "Use VPM HTTP, metadata, logging and JWS implementations.",
    "Validate and isolate self-signed JWT cache entries by claims and credentials.",
    "Coalesce forced token refreshes and validate token expiry before caching.",
    "Verify ID tokens with canonical JWS parsing, algorithm/key agreement and finite numeric timestamps.",
    "Keep token content out of verification errors and request/response debug logs.",
    "Keep public declarations independent of ambient Node, Undici and DOM types.",
    "Reuse parsed immutable private keys only per owning credential object; bound self-signed JWT cache to 500 entries.",
    "Supply key-file issuer before signing; return revocation promises, use POST form bodies and preserve newer tokens.",
    "Preserve transport errors instead of copying untrusted token response text into their messages."
  ]
